      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 19 Tymonville Avenue to the market — a spacious three-bedroom mid-terrace home with heaps of potential, ideally positioned in this mature and popular Tallaght development. The property is conveniently located close to schools, shops, parks and leisure facilities, with Tallaght Village, The Square Shopping Centre, excellent public transport links and major road networks all within easy reach. No. 19 is an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers and families looking to put their own stamp on a home in Dublin 24.\nBright, airy and spacious, this fantastic three-bedroom home offers approximately 81 sq. m. of well-proportioned living accommodation and presents an ideal blank canvas for its new owners to make their own. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a cosy living room with a feature fireplace, and a fully fitted kitchen offering ample storage, which opens into a generous dining area. Upstairs, there are three spacious bedrooms, along with a tiled family bathroom. To the rear, the property boasts a sunny, private and fully enclosed low-maintenance garden, providing an ideal space for outdoor dining, entertaining or relaxing. To the front, a large driveway offers ample off-street parking for multiple cars. Additional features include gas-fired central heating, generous room proportions, no onward chain and excellent potential throughout. This wonderful property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers and growing families alike, particularly those looking to put down roots in a fantastic, well-established area.\nContact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 086 822 5318 or 01 908 9300 to arrange a viewing. Early interest is expected, so don't miss out!\n\nFeatures;\n- c.81 sq.m\n- 3 Bed/ 1 Bath Mid Terrace\n-Spacious room proportions\n-Large driveway\n-Gas fired central heating\n-BER C\n-Heaps of potential\n-Family friendly location\n-Prime for first time buyers & growing families\n-No onward chain\n-Bus routes & schools on your doorstep\n-Close proximity to Tallaght Village & The Square Shopping Centre\n-Within arm's reach of M50 & N7 motorway\n-Early viewing strongly advised!\n\nDirections: Eircode is D24 K6P6"
      },
      {
